    "whoAmICardText": "I am a 25-year-old freelance photographer based in Singapore, specializing in portrait, lifestyle, and street photography. When I’m not behind the camera, you’ll most likely find me hiking through the countryside, exploring quiet forests or hidden trails just outside the city.",
